      "description": {
        "type": "/type/text",
        "value": "\"Just as Watergate was the defining story of its time, so Enron is the biggest business story of our time. And just as All the President's Men was the one Watergate book that gave readers the full story, with all the drama and nuance, The Smartest Guys in the Room is the one book you have to read to understand this business saga.\"--BOOK JACKET."
      },
